      "post": {
        "summary": "Generate a segment-scoped in-depth narrative summary (202)",
        "description": "Submits the LLM call onto the shared in-depth summary pool and returns the Redis `task_id` for polling. `item_key` is a KPI (theme) name or `'__overview__'` for the segment-level narrative. Costs 1 APS credit (402 when the org has none left).",
