    "/analysis/{analysis_id}/flags/sub-flags/merge": {
      "patch": {
        "summary": "Merge 2+ sub-categories of one monitor into one",
        "description": "Fuse the selected sub-categories of a single monitor into one (#2795): every matched response's sub-category is rewritten to the merged name and de-duplicated, the curated option list, the per-comment overrides, the cached sub-category summaries and the arrival-time scan rows are all updated together. Naming follows the theme-merge rule. 409 while another edit holds a per-content lock.",
