    "/analysis/{analysis_id}/{content_id}/themes/regenerate-summary": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "Regenerate one theme's stored summary",
        "description": "Rebuild the stored basic summary of a single persisted theme from its current member comments (#2549): same condense + sentiment-polish chain as analysis time, now carrying the language pins and post-generation language guard. Membership, sentiment and sub-themes are untouched; the theme's consistency verdict is reset. The 1-click repair for a wrong-language, hallucinated or truncated summary \u2014 no full re-analysis needed. Depth-text questions only. 409 while another edit holds the per-content lock.",
