      "get": {
        "summary": "MCP-capable API keys and the user each one inherits access from",
        "description": "Lists the organization's keys that can reach POST /api/mcp (permission `mcp_read` or `all`), each with the user who minted it and whether that user still grants it access. A key whose `binding_state` is not `active` is refused at /api/mcp until an admin revokes it and mints a new one.",
