          }
        ]
      },
      "post": {
        "summary": "Upload a custom report font",
        "description": "Store a TrueType / OpenType / WOFF / WOFF2 file under a family name for the active org. The file is sniffed (never trusted by extension) and capped at 2048 KB. A family may contain one file for each weight and style combination; an org stores at most 20 font files in total.",
        "tags": [
          "Reports"
