        "description": "Per-question switches for #2597 probing and #2599 collection-time analysis. Saved on its own rather than through the survey save, because both are edited on a PUBLISHED survey mid-fieldwork \u2014 the one moment an author must not be made to re-save a questionnaire respondents are filling in.",
