        "description": "Read-only registry + coverage read (`source_count` / `total_mentions` / `has_results`); never recomputes. `timeframe` + `period_key` scope the coverage figures to a rollup or evolution bucket. For a group with no effective sources the registry rows are still returned but the stale detection fields are zeroed.",
