      "delete": {
        "summary": "Delete a monitor and cascade-remove its detections",
        "description": "Removes the registry row and best-effort strips the flag from every source analysis (definitions + per-comment detections + forward-coverage seeds) so a recompute can't resurrect it. `cascade.complete: false` means some sources may still carry stale detections. A concurrent-delete no-op returns `deleted: false` without a cascade.",
