        "description": "Generic analysis-data envelope.\n\nUsed by ``/<analysis_id>/data``, ``/data/<page>/<limit>``,\n``/data/<page>/<limit>/complete``, ``/data/sanitized``, and\n``/data/<content_id>``. The exact key set varies per route \u2014 declared\nkeys are the ones every variant carries; the rest flow through via\n``extra=\"allow\"``.",
