        "description": "``GET /surveys/<id>/geo-trend`` payload (AI Visibility evolution view).\n\nPer-evolution-period visibility rate + share of voice, one series per\nplatform plus an ``__overall__`` line, in the shape the evolution\n``WidgetTrendChart`` renders (percent unit, [0, 100] domain). Points\nexist only for periods with data \u2014 a period with none is a chart gap,\nnever a fabricated 0.",
