        "description": "``POST /surveys/<survey_id>/quotas/evaluate`` \u2014 the best-effort check.\n\nRead-only: it reports which cells the given state matches and whether\nthe interview should end, and it NEVER moves a counter. That is the\npreview guarantee \u2014 an author testing their own questionnaire must not\nburn quota slots.",
