        "description": "``POST /surveys/<survey_id>/quality/decision`` \u2014 keep or exclude, bulk.\n\n``excluded=false`` is the un-exclude: the same endpoint with the other\nvalue, because reversibility is the same decision and not a feature of\nits own.",
