        "additionalProperties": true,
        "description": "``GET /surveys/<survey_id>/simulations/toplines`` \u2014 per-question\ntoplines over the SIMULATED records only (#2593). Each ``questions``\nentry is a portal-shaped topline (``question_id``, ``question_text``,\n``question_type``, ``total_responses`` plus ``options`` /\n``distribution`` / ``response_count`` by type).",
        "properties": {
