        "additionalProperties": true,
        "description": "``GET /surveys/<survey_id>/verifications/publish-check``.\n\n``blocking`` is always ``false`` and is part of the contract, not a\nplaceholder: an unreachable question is a legitimate state mid-editing,\nand a tool that blocks publish on an analysis result gets switched off.",
