        "description": "``GET /scrapers/<id>/delete-impact`` \u2014 counts the data-loss footprint\nof a PURGE delete. ``deletable_survey_count`` are the surveys exclusively\nowned by this scraper (will be hard-deleted); the remainder are shared and\nwill be re-homed to their surviving sibling scraper's group or kept\nattached where they are (#2545 \u2014 never detached, never destroyed). The\nfield keeps its historical name ``detachable_survey_count`` for wire\ncompatibility.",
