      "ReviewGeoPromptsResponse": {
        "additionalProperties": true,
        "description": "``POST /scrapers/review-geo-prompts`` payload.\n\n``prompts`` is the grammar-corrected GEO prompt set, same count and\norder as the request (template variants are filled with a free-form\ncategory, so agreement/plurality can break \u2014 e.g. FR gender:\n\"les meilleurs Compagnies\" \u2192 \"les meilleures compagnies\").\n``reviewed`` is False when the LLM pass failed and the originals\nwere returned unchanged \u2014 the caller may use them as-is (the raw\ntemplates are always valid prompts, just possibly ungrammatical).",
        "properties": {
          "prompts": {
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
