      "NativeSyncStartedResponse": {
        "description": "202-equivalent for a natively-fed group's \"sync now\".\n\nSame ``status`` vocabulary as the per-connector routes'\n``ManualSyncResponse``, plus the pre-sync ``subscription`` snapshot\nthe frontend pollers diff against to decide when the run finished\n(a native group has no partner subscription to poll for that).\n\nDeliberately NOT ``SyncStartedResponse``: that body promises\n``message`` and ``subscription_id``, and a native flow has neither \u2014\nits id belongs to a different sequence than the partner subscription\nids the panel's Pause/Resume would send it to.",
        "properties": {
          "status": {
            "description": "queued | started",
            "title": "Status",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "kind": {
            "default": "native_connector",
            "description": "Marks the native branch so callers poll source-info",
            "title": "Kind",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "subscription": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "additionalProperties": true,
                "type": "object"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "default": null,
            "description": "Pre-sync snapshot, in the partner field names",
            "title": "Subscription"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "status"
        ],
        "title": "NativeSyncStartedResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
