      "SurveyMonkeyOAuthClaimRequest": {
        "description": "Body for ``POST /native-connectors/cx/surveymonkey/oauth/claim``.\n\nThe code the OAuth callback handed to the browser. Redeeming it is\nwhat actually creates the connection, in the CALLER's organization \u2014\nthe unauthenticated callback never creates anything.",
