        "description": "Body for ``PATCH /native-connectors/medallia/connections/{id}``.\n\nEvery field is optional and anything absent is left untouched. An\nOMITTED ``client_secret`` keeps the stored one, so a rename never\nrequires possessing the credential; an empty one is rejected rather\nthan treated as \"clear it\", because clearing a credential to nothing\nis never what was meant.",
