      "MedalliaFieldUsageResponse": {
        "additionalProperties": true,
        "description": "Fill rate per field, over the sampled records.\n\nThe 200 answer. A client that sends ``Prefer: respond-async`` gets 202\nwith a ``MedalliaProbeJobResponse`` instead and polls\n``GET /medallia/probe-jobs/{job_id}``, whose 200 carries this report.",
