      "RelevanceAuditProposal": {
        "additionalProperties": true,
        "description": "One edit-in-place keep-rule change.\n\n``old_text`` must match the addressed rule's current criterion\nverbatim; the backend rejects the whole request otherwise. The single\nexception is a scraper with no keep rules at all, where the one\npermitted proposal is ``rule_index: 0`` with an empty ``old_text``.",
